---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const demoHref =
  'mailto:comporell@gmail.com?subject=Leave%20Plan%20demo%20request';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Leave Plan — Leave & attendance for Odoo 19</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Leave Plan is a leave and attendance module for Odoo 19: entries are final the moment they're logged, dates compute themselves, and one calendar shows the whole team."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Leave Plan — Leave & attendance for Odoo 19" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="No approval queue — leave, absence, and lateness are settled the moment they're entered, with dates and summaries computed automatically."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://obura.io/leave-plan" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="topnav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Obura <span>Studios</span></a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href={demoHref}>Request a demo</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- 1. Hero -->
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="kicker">By Obura Studios · Built for Odoo 19</p>
        <div class="app-title">
          <span class="app-mark" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2" /><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4" /><path d="M8.5 15l2 2 5-5" /></svg>
          </span>
          <h1>Leave Plan</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="value-prop">
          Leave decisions, <em>settled the moment they're entered.</em>
        </p>
        <p class="flow-line">Leave · Absence · Lateness — one calendar</p>
        <p class="sub">
          Leave Plan is a leave and attendance module for Odoo 19. There's no
          approval queue: a leave, absence, or lateness entry is final the
          instant it's logged, and the dates, calendar, and summaries work
          themselves out from there.
        </p>
        <div class="store-row">
          <a class="btn-primary" href={demoHref}>Request a demo</a>
          <span class="cta-badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" /><path d="M3 9h18M9 3v6" /></svg>
            Odoo 19 module
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mark-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 240">
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="180" rx="14" />
            <line x1="30" y1="70" x2="170" y2="70" />
            <line x1="60" y1="20" x2="60" y2="42" />
            <line x1="140" y1="20" x2="140" y2="42" />
            <rect class="fill" x="52" y="94" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="92" y="94" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="132" y="94" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="52" y="128" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect class="fill" x="92" y="128" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="132" y="128" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="52" y="162" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect x="92" y="162" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
            <rect class="fill" x="132" y="162" width="26" height="20" rx="4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- 2. The problem -->
      <section class="problem" aria-label="The problem">
        <h2 class="visually-hidden">The problem</h2>
        <div class="problem-grid">
          <div class="pain">
            <h3>Leave stuck in a queue</h3>
            <p>
              A request sits waiting for a signature while the calendar
              nobody trusts stays out of date.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pain">
            <h3>Manual date math</h3>
            <p>
              Counting workdays by hand, forgetting Sundays, arguing over
              whether a holiday should count against someone's leave.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pain">
            <h3>No shared picture</h3>
            <p>
              Who's out, who's late how often, who's used what type of leave
              — scattered across spreadsheets no one keeps current.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Features -->
      <section class="features" id="features">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Leave that resolves itself</h2>
          <p>Real features, no filler. This is what Leave Plan does.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-group">
          <h3 class="group-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6" /></svg>
            Instant, no approval queue
          </h3>
          <div class="feature-grid two">
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16M4 12h16M4 19h10" /></svg>
              <h4>Final the moment it's entered</h4>
              <p>
                A leave, absence, or lateness record is settled as soon as
                it's logged — no pending state, no waiting on a signature.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><path d="M3 10h18" /></svg>
              <h4>Dates that compute themselves</h4>
              <p>
                Pick a start date and a day count, and the end date works
                itself out — Sundays are never counted against leave days.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-group">
          <h3 class="group-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5-7-10V6z" /></svg>
            Holidays, your rules
          </h3>
          <div class="feature-grid two">
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16M4 12h16M4 19h10" /></svg>
              <h4>Configurable holiday deduction</h4>
              <p>
                An administrator sets whether public holidays count against
                leave. By default they don't — except New Year's, Kurban
                Bayram, and Ramadan Bayram.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4" /></svg>
              <h4>One calendar, color-coded</h4>
              <p>
                Leave, public holidays, and absences all sit on the same
                calendar, colored by type.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-group">
          <h3 class="group-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20" /><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z" /></svg>
            Absence, sick leave &amp; overtime tracking
          </h3>
          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" /></svg>
              <h4>Convert with one tap</h4>
              <p>
                An absence record becomes a sick leave record in a single
                "Convert to leave" action.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20" /><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z" /></svg>
              <h4>Sick reports as attachments</h4>
              <p>
                A medical report attaches straight to its leave record as a
                document.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 7v5l3 3" /></svg>
              <h4>Lateness, down to the minute</h4>
              <p>
                Late arrivals and early departures are logged in minutes,
                with a monthly pivot summary report.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-group">
          <h3 class="group-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3.2" /><path d="M2.5 20a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0" /><circle cx="18" cy="9" r="2.6" /><path d="M14.5 20a4.2 4.2 0 0 1 7.5-2.6" /></svg>
            Summaries &amp; access
          </h3>
          <div class="feature-grid two">
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" /><path d="M7 15v-3M12 15V9M17 15v-5" /></svg>
              <h4>Grouped by leave type</h4>
              <p>
                Who used how much of which leave type, all on one screen.
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3" /></svg>
              <h4>Scoped by role</h4>
              <p>
                Employees see only their own records. Managers see the whole
                team and its allocations.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. How it works -->
      <section class="how" id="how-it-works">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>How it works</h2>
          <p>From one entry to a team-wide picture, instantly.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <h3>Log the entry</h3>
            <p>
              Leave, absence, or lateness — enter it once, with a start date
              and how many days or minutes.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <h3>It's already final</h3>
            <p>
              No approval step. End dates, working-day counts, and holiday
              rules are worked out automatically.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            <h3>It's on the calendar</h3>
            <p>
              Visible immediately on the shared calendar and rolled into that
              employee's type-by-type summary.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Closing CTA -->
      <section class="closing">
        <h2>See your own team's calendar running in it.</h2>
        <div class="store-row center">
          <a class="btn-primary big" href={demoHref}>Request a demo</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- 5. Footer -->
    <footer>
      <p>&copy; {year} Obura</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6faf8;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --border: #dcebe3;
    --text: #17211c;
    --muted: #5b6b62;
    --accent: #059669;
    --accent-strong: #047a56;
    --accent-soft: #e4f5ee;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 30, 24, 0.05), 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 30, 24, 0.06);
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0f1512;
      --surface: #17201b;
      --border: #26332c;
      --text: #e6ede9;
      --muted: #96a59d;
      --accent: #4ade9b;
      --accent-strong: #74e6b3;
      --accent-soft: #1a2e25;
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
    html {
      color-scheme: dark;
    }
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
  }

  html {
    color-scheme: light;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      'Segoe UI',
      sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  svg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.7;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .topnav {
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .brand span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-cta {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero {
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      padding-top: 4.5rem;
    }
  }

  .kicker {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .app-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .app-mark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    height: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    border-radius: 26%;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .app-mark svg {
    width: 55%;
    height: 55%;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .flow-line {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-prop {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .value-prop em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .store-row {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .store-row.center {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent-strong);
  }

  .btn-primary.big {
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.7rem;
  }

  .cta-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cta-badge svg {
    width: 1.1em;
    height: 1.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .mark-card {
    width: min(15rem, 70vw);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .mark-card svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }

  .mark-card svg .fill {
    fill: var(--accent);
    fill-opacity: 0.18;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  section {
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-head p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .problem {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .pain {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .pain h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .pain p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-group {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .group-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  .group-title svg {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 980px) {
    .feature-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
    .feature-grid.two {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .feature {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .feature > svg {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .feature h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .feature p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .how {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .steps li {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .step-num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .steps h3 {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .steps p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .closing {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .closing h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 1.9rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
